": "Akshay", "text": "Will give it", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:25:23Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "The exact term is vapor pressure", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:25:36Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Only Z is left", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:26:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Natural gas", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:26:31Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "natural gas is correct", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:26:36Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "And done", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:27:18Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Most Lpg produced in america comes from shale gas processing", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:27:35Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Lpg in the ME and India is a byproduct of crude distillation", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:27:44Z", "username": "Vyomaa Patel", "text": "TIL", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:28:06Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Colder countries use propane rich lpg because a much higher vapor pressure so is likelier to vaporize", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-13T21:28:27Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "But butane has much higher volumetric energy content, though it doesnt vaporize below ~3 degC", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "h